                    (10, "body", "℞ p[ro]pe sunt q[ue] most eq[ue] to drawe water oute of Sweluid legg[es] ☾", "Near are [remedies] most fit to draw water out of swelled legs. ☾", ""),
                    (11, "heading", "for the Dropsie", "For the dropsy", ""),
