                    (2, "body", "A close Bottom: and a stand a foot off or lesse to put in a false bottom: w[i]t[h]in the tubb", "A close bottom, and a stand a foot off or less to put in a false bottom within the tub,", "Continuation of sweat-tub directions."),
                    (3, "body", "order a pan of coales & heate it hott: then put in y[e] false bottom close. set y[e] p[atient]", "order a pan of coals and heat it hot; then put in the false bottom close; set the patient's", ""),
                    (4, "body", "legges on the false bottom in the tubb and at his feete apon the false bottom", "legs on the false bottom in the tub and at his feet upon the false bottom;", ""),
                    (5, "body", "cover all w[i]t[h] clothes and so let him sweate on howre: then put him into", "cover all with cloths and so let him sweat one hour; then put him into", ""),
                    (6, "body", "a warme bedd & cover him well so this wille his water come in the", "a warm bed and cover him well; so will his water come in the", ""),
                    (7, "body", "legge to grounde. the false bottom wold haue holes in ytt. This was", "leg to ground. The false bottom should have holes in it. This was", ""),
